<title>USA: Morrison Knudsen venture gets Utah contract.</title>
<headline>Morrison Knudsen venture gets Utah contract.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Knudsen Corp said Wasatch Constructors, its joint venture with Kiewit Pacific Co and Granite Construction Co, got a contract from the Utah Department of Transportation, worth $1.4 billion.</p>
<p>Morrison Knudsen's share is 20 percent, or about $280 million.</p>
<p>&quot;This award demonstrates continued expansion of our large, design/build capabilities,&quot; said Robert Tinstman, Morrison Knudsen chief executive officer.</p>
